{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/10/0336611/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人とも眠そうなの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/10/0336611/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がうっち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公演のリハがスタートしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうなるのかまだわからないけど、\nとにかく楽しみたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...と、言いたいところなんだけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の夏に味わった過酷な毎日。\nあのときと同じようにみなさんに\n心配をおかけしてしまう\nかもしれません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、逃げないし。\n諦めないし、負けないし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の16人のプリンシパルdeuxは\n私たちにとって、\nまた新たな挑戦となります。\n去年とはまた少し違うのよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/10/0336611/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしていてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスンルームに入ると\n必ず顔が熱くなって\n耳が真っ赤になる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさんにこれを言ったら\n「拒否反応じゃない？」\nと言われた..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何を嫌がっているんだ！\nそんなに嫌なことがあったのか？\n嘘だろ！そんなはずない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/10/0336611/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスンルームは居心地が良いぞ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/10/0336611/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで顔が熱くなって\n耳真っ赤になっちゃうのかなー？\n人間のからだってよくわからんな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新学期。\n春休みが終わり、\n学校が始まりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クラスは親友と一緒だったし、\nそれだけでもう一安心"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/10/0336611/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう本当に変だわー\n変な写メ送ってくるし\n反応に困るわー笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも楽しいーー\n私も撮って送りつけようかな。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高3になって勉強とか\n忙しくなると思うけど、\n逃げずに頑張らなきゃだな。うん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学生のみなさん！\n一緒に頑張りましょうっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/10/0336611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/10/0336611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/10/0336611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/10/0336611/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"荒ぶる玲香。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........\nGiRLPOP TV\n今週もあみ、れな、まりかが担当。\nレゴランドでのびのびしてきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/10/0336611/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レゴだいすきだからこれは\n嬉しかったなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の放送を見逃した方は\n明日の25:30～26:00\nぜひ見てください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}